  WrittenDialogue: "Who thought I’d be doing this a year later!\nI can’t say this enough, I’m so glad you showed up to that party.\nThose pictures you took at the pool got me discovered and now it’s a whole career!\nI can pay my own rent and date celebrities, couldn’t ask for more.\nRemember that guy who drowned to death in my pool? I wonder what he’s doing now...\nThat was such a hard day for me, but look how it turned out.\nAfter I wrap this bodywash ad I can show you around the city.\nJust sit back, you’ll see modeling is some really hard work!"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
